# Commit messages

Write the message for a reader who was not in the session. One or two sentences. Say why the change was made and what it changes for the model, dashboard, or workflow.

Use a complete sentence, the way recent history does:

```text
Rename the payment fact to fact_payment so the name covers incoming and outgoing payments.
```

```text
Record product as a first-class payments attribute so dashboards can filter B4B, B4S, and OVERSIGHT without portal table names.
```

Leave out file lists, secret values, and labels such as `WIP` or `update files`. If the first sentence cannot carry the reason, add a short second sentence.
